            <note corresp="#d746-f3" n="62" xml:id="d746-f3-content">
                <p>According to telegram 8334, December 26, from Bern, official acceptance by the
                    German Government of Swiss proposal to effect exchange in Switzerland was
                    received by the Swiss Foreign Office on December 26 (711.62114
                    Sick/12–2644).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
